==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[ná]]'' meaning "to [[get]]" and ''[[sér#Icelandic|sér]]'' the {{dat}} of ''[[sig#Icelandic|sig]]'' meaning "[[oneself]]".

===Verb===
'''[[ná#Icelandic|ná]] [[sig#Icelandic|sér]]'''

# to [[pull through]]
# to [[recover]], to become ''well'' again
#: ''Efnahagurinn mun ekki '''ná sér'''.''
#:: The economy will not '''recover'''.
# {{mostly|used of a person|lang=is}} to [[pull oneself together]], to recover [[health]] or strength, to [[rally]], [[recuperate]]

====Synonyms====
* {{i-c|to pull through}} [[komast yfir]]
* {{i-c|pull oneself together}} [[jafna sig]]

====Derived terms====
* [[ná sér í]]

